				<img height="283" src="img/bettaDP_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/BANDAI/betta/img/bettaDP.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
